Found on k183 (2026-11-13). Skilletor::JSON::js_parse slows down sharply on big input: each _string/_number call copies the whole text (my $s = $p->{s}). A 221 KB file takes about 22 s, an 89 KB one 2.5 s. Configs and locks are small, but a large lock or state file would stall a hook. Done: parse in place (pos()/\G on the one string, or a reference), same results and error messages (t/10-json.t oracle green), a timing guard in a test.

